    "The editor is available in the rail, the chat, and the panel areas." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The editor is available in the rail, the chat, and the panel areas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编辑器可在侧栏、聊天与面板区域中使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯器可在側欄、聊天與面板區域中使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯器可在側欄、聊天與面板區域中使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯器可在側欄、聊天與面板區域中使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The editor is provided by the system; if it shows Editor service unavailable, enable the editor-related plugins and restart the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The editor is provided by the system; if it shows Editor service unavailable, enable the editor-related plugins and restart the app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编辑器由系统提供;若显示「编辑器服务不可用」,请启用编辑器相关插件并重启应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯器由系統提供;若顯示「編輯器服務不可用」,請啟用編輯器相關外掛並重新啟動應用程式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯器由系統提供;若顯示「編輯器服務不可用」,請啟用編輯器相關外掛並重新啟動應用程式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編輯器由系統提供;若顯示「編輯器服務不可用」,請啟用編輯器相關外掛並重新啟動應用程式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the built-in Code Editor: browsing and editing project files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the built-in Code Editor: browsing and editing project files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本手册介绍内置代码编辑器的界面与基本操作:浏览与编辑项目文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本手冊介紹內建程式碼編輯器的介面與基本操作:瀏覽與編輯專案檔案。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
